Limits: all 146 targeted and 21 entrypoint controls independently passed; their success does not cover this timeout mismatch. Real hosted scheduler exhaustion and later successful normal processing/accounting were independently verified and remain valid. No actual forced cancellation or publication failure is claimed, and no fix, merge, deployment, provider access/import or geography approval was performed.

